ight=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>پاسخ به نیاز کاربر</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg bg-card text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group animate-fade-in border-0 shadow-lg\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-amber-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-amber-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-trending-up h-6 w-6 text-amber-600\"><polyline points=\"22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17\"></polyline><polyline points=\"16 7 22 7 22 13\"></polyline></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-xl font-semibold\">استراتژی Topical Authority</h3></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed\">پوشش جامع تمام زیرمجموعه‌های موضوعی کسب‌وکار شما برای اثبات تخصص به گوگل.</p><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>مرجعیت در بازار</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>رتبه‌بندی سریع‌تر</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>اعتماد گوگل</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg bg-card text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group animate-fade-in border-0 shadow-lg\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-amber-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-amber-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search h-6 w-6 text-amber-600\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-xl font-semibold\">تحقیق کلمات کلیدی معنایی</h3></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed\">فراتر از کلمات کلیدی ساده؛ تمرکز بر نیت کاربر (User Intent) و مفاهیم مرتبط.</p><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>هدف‌گیری دقیق</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>نرخ تبدیل بالاتر</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>پوشش کامل موضوع</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg bg-card text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group animate-fade-in border-0 shadow-lg\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-amber-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-amber-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-align-justify h-6 w-6 text-amber-600\"><path d=\"M3 12h18\"></path><path d=\"M3 18h18\"></path><path d=\"M3 6h18\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-xl font-semibold\">بهینه‌سازی محتوای موجود</h3></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed\">بروزرسانی و غنی‌سازی مقالات قدیمی برای بازگرداندن رتبه‌های از دست رفته.</p><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>رشد سریع ترافیک</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>استفاده از دارایی موجود</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>بهبود تازگی محتوا</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-padding bg-slate-50\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6\">خدمات <span class=\"gradient-text\">لینک‌سازی و اعتبار</span> (Authority)</h2><p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">افزایش اعتبار دامنه شما نزد گوگل با استراتژی‌های لینک‌سازی امن و مؤثر</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"><div class=\"rounded-lg text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group animate-fade-in border-0 shadow-lg bg-white\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-purple-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-purple-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-link h-6 w-6 text-purple-600\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-xl font-semibold\">لینک‌سازی خارجی (Link Building)</h3></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed\">کسب بک‌لینک‌های باکیفیت از سایت‌های معتبر و مرتبط با حوزه کاری شما.</p><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>افزایش اعتبار دامنه</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>بهبود رتبه کلمات سخت</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>ترافیک ارجاعی</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group animate-fade-in border-0 shadow-lg bg-white\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-purple-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-purple-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text h-6 w-6 text-purple-600\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-xl font-semibold\">رپورتاژ آگهی هدفمند</h3></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed\">انتشار اخبار و مقالات شما در رسانه‌های خبری بزرگ برای برندسازی و سئو.</p><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>برندسازی قوی</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>لینک‌های دائمی</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>اعتماد مخاطب</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group animate-fade-in border-0 shadow-lg bg-white\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-purple-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-purple-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield h-6 w-6 text-purple-600\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-xl font-semibold\">مدیریت پروفایل لینک</h3></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed\">پایش مداوم بک‌لینک‌ها و حذف لینک‌های اسپم (Disavow) برای جلوگیری از جریمه.</p><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>امنیت سایت</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>جلوگیری از پنالتی</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>حفظ سلامت دامنه</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group animate-fade-in border-0 shadow-lg bg-white\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-purple-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-purple-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-target h-6 w-6 text-purple-600\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-xl font-semibold\">لینک‌سازی داخلی پیشرفته</h3></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed\">طراحی ساختار لینک‌های داخلی برای توزیع قدرت (Link Juice) در تمام صفحات سایت.</p><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>اینکس بهتر</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>افزایش قدرت صفحات</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>ناوبری بهتر</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-padding bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-50 to-indigo-50\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6\">انواع <span class=\"gradient-text\">محتوای استراتژیک</span></h2><p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">ما برای هر مرحله از قیف فروش، محتوای مناسب تولید می‌کنیم</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"><div class=\"rounded-lg text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group border-0 shadow-lg bg-white\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-indigo-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-indigo-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text h-6 w-6 text-indigo-600\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-xl font-semibold\">مقاله تخصصی</h3></div><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4\">مقاله‌های عمیق و فنی برای جذب مشتریان حرفه‌ای</p></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><div class=\"space-y-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>بررسی جامع موضوع</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>نمودارها و آیتم‌پسند</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>فراخوان به اقدام قوی</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group border-0 shadow-lg bg-white\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-indigo-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-indigo-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open h-6 w-6 text-indigo-600\"><path d=\"M12 7v14\"></path><path d=\"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-xl font-semibold\">راهنمای عملی</h3></div><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4\">آموزش گام به گام حل مشکلات کاربران</p></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><div class=\"space-y-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>توضیح مرحله به مرحله</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>نمونه‌های عملی</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>بهینه برای رتبه‌بندی</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group border-0 shadow-lg bg-white\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-indigo-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-indigo-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-target h-6 w-6 text-indigo-600\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-xl font-semibold\">مطالعات موردی</h3></div><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4\">نمایش نتایج واقعی پروژه‌های موفق</p></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><div class=\"space-y-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>تقارن با مشتریان</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>اعداد و آمار واقعی</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>اعتمادسازی بالا</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group border-0 shadow-lg bg-white\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-indigo-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-indigo-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-trending-up h-6 w-6 text-indigo-600\"><polyline points=\"22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17\"></polyline><polyline points=\"16 7 22 7 22 13\"></polyline></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-xl font-semibold\">پست‌های ترند</h3></div><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4\">پوشش اخبار روز و موضوعات داغ</p></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><div class=\"space-y-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>سرعت تغییرات بالا</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>بازاریابی ویروسی</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>ترافیک فوری</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-padding\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6\">سوالات <span class=\"gradient-text\">متداول</span></h2><p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">پاسخ به سوالات شما درباره محتوا و لینک‌سازی</p></div><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-4\"><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight text-lg text-right flex items-center gap-2\"><span>چرا محتوا پادشاه است؟</span></h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-right leading-relaxed\">چون گوگل به دنبال پاسخ دادن به سوالات کاربران است. محتوای باکیفیت تنها راهی است که می‌توانید به این نیاز پاسخ دهید و گوگل را راضی کنید.</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight text-lg text-right flex items-center gap-2\"><span>آیا خرید بک‌لینک توصیه می‌شود؟</span></h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-right leading-relaxed\">خرید لینک‌های بی‌کیفیت و انبوه خطرناک است. ما بر روی &quot;ساخت&quot; لینک از طریق روابط عمومی، محتوای عالی و رپورتاژهای باکیفیت تمرکز داریم که کاملاً امن است.</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight text-lg text-right flex items-center gap-2\"><span>Topical Authority چقدر زمان می‌برد؟</span></h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-right leading-relaxed\">بسته به رقابت حوزه شما، معمولاً با تولید ۲۰ تا ۵۰ مقاله مرتبط و لینک‌سازی داخلی صحیح، ظرف ۳ تا ۶ ماه می‌توانید به مرجعیت موضوعی برسید.</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight text-lg text-right flex items-center gap-2\"><span>آیا محتوای شما کپی نیست؟</span></h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-right leading-relaxed\">خیر، تمام محتواها توسط نویسندگان متخصص نوشته شده و از نظر یونیک بودن و کیفیت نگارش به دقت بررسی می‌شوند.</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight text-lg text-right flex items-center gap-2\"><span>تأثیر رپورتاژ آگهی چقدر است؟</span></h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-right leading-relaxed\">رپورتاژ آگهی اگر در رسانه درست و با متن مناسب منتشر شود، یکی از قوی‌ترین سیگنال‌های سئو است که هم اعتبار دامنه را بالا می‌برد و هم ترافیک مستقیم می‌آورد.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-padding bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 to-slate-800 text-white\"><div class=\"container-custom text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6\">صدای برند خود را به گوش همه برسانید!</h2><p class=\"text-xl mb-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto opacity-90\">با محتوای قدرتمند و اعتبار دامنه بالا، جایگاه خود را در صدر نتایج گوگل تثبیت کنید. ما استراتژی، تولید و توزیع را برای شما انجام می‌دهیم.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 h-11 rounded-md px-8 bg-amber-600 hover:bg-amber-700 text-white\">شروع کمپین محتوایی</button><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 border bg-background h-11 rounded-md px-8 border-white text-white hover:bg-white hover:text-slate-900\">مشاوره رایگان</button></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"bg-slate-900 text-white\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"py-12 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-c